Z||000000||FieroKyle||11-02-2001||01:12 AM||||Well, in my most recent accident going on almost a month ago, the Fiero is still in the nody shop. It should be done here a week or two, then put it up for the winter. Its sad really, it seems like I just took it out of the covers for the summer just yesterday. Its sad, I really miss it. Now its off driving my Regal for 6 months. I will have to get pics of and post in on my sig.... LoL. You all soon will be putting the Fiero's up for the winter. Saddest day of year when ya pack it up and put it away. I swear a tear gets in my eye.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>A dissapointed Fiero owner because time passes so quick.....<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0PgAgVMwT!1W9RUb20vChbvv6QaE!2K1LWrFB6SxTnTchZgvIygv7Y3YwXpVdD8GeNkWpurYfoQxvNRK6j6kEmOFLoIHavbIr/Kyle-85-GT.jpg">    <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
